    "detailed_description": "You know what? Gals are tough on cults,..,<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788360/extras/82cee24ec5c5cee8c769c170805bd25d.poster.avif?t=1723555832\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788360/extras/82cee24ec5c5cee8c769c170805bd25d.webm?t=1723555832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788360/extras/82cee24ec5c5cee8c769c170805bd25d.mp4?t=1723555832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Imperial year 248.<br><br>The empire is in the midst of deteriorating security, hopeless diplomatic relations, and endless war.<br>The oppressed people of the devastated society believe in the apocalypse, and soon a huge religious organization rises up.<br><br>People were kidnapped by the organization and disappeared one by one.<br>The empire sent its own troops to the organization, but they were all destroyed.<br><br>The imperial army, unable to devote its strength to the country due to the worsening war situation with neighboring countries,<br>They transferred one gal to a religious organization, Galwoya. \u30fb\u30fb\u30fb\u30fb<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788360/extras/3c53d6485d3eb3b671dd6ed82d2e6dd9.avif?t=1723555832\" width=481 height=342 /></span><br><br>CULT VS GAL is an ultra old-school, yet high-tempo, user-friendly FPS.<br>Take control of the &quot;Hell Smasher Saki&quot; and destroy the cult that threatens the empire!<br><br>This is a 4-episode, 16+ map, old school FPS.<br>The simplified maps do not interfere with your fighting instincts and allow you to just focus on fighting the cult.<br><br>Right click to manufacture raw heads!<br><br>When you cut off a head, Saki's tension rises and she becomes invincible for a moment.<br>Close combat is dangerous, but daring to charge in and hunt for the head is one of the strategies.<br><br>You can unleash a melee attack that can pop a cult's head off in an instant.<br>Mince the cult with your shotgun, tactically attack with your assault rifle, and slash the cult's head off with your machete!<br><br>Sounds effect's<br>\u7460\u7483\u9ad8\u539f <br><br>Using this template by Play8Bitars<br>",
