on rises and she becomes invincible for a moment.<br>Close combat is dangerous, but daring to charge in and hunt for the head is one of the strategies.<br><br>You can unleash a melee attack that can pop a cult's head off in an instant.<br>Mince the cult with your shotgun, tactically attack with your assault rifle, and slash the cult's head off with your machete!<br><br>Sounds effect's<br>\u7460\u7483\u9ad8\u539f <br><br>Using this template by Play8Bitars<br>",
